  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2025000,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202500000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202500000": {
          "id": 202500000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Address: Pier Point Interastral Peace Corporation, Strategic Investment Department, Pearl's Personal Studio, 3F.",
          "next": [
            202500001
          ]
        },
        "202500001": {
          "id": 202500001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}, if the Astral Express ever has any damaged or discarded items you plan to get rid of, feel free to send them my way. I'll take care of recycling them.",
          "next": [
            202500002,
            202500005
          ]
        },
        "202500002": {
          "id": 202500002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Is this your side hustle?",
          "next": [
            202500003
          ]
        },
        "202500003": {
          "id": 202500003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "A side hustle, by definition, is a secondary job with economic income, done outside your main job during your spare time.",
          "next": [
            202500004
          ]
        },
        "202500004": {
          "id": 202500004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "But strictly speaking, my \"Waste Recycling Program\" is actually me paying you.",
          "next": [
            202500009
          ]
        },
        "202500005": {
          "id": 202500005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Waste? Where? Can people be recycled?",
          "next": [
            202500006
          ]
        },
        "202500006": {
          "id": 202500006,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202500007
          ]
        },
        "202500007": {
          "id": 202500007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Technically speaking, organic life can also be \"repurposed.\" It's just that the quote for that service is outside my budget.",
          "next": [
            202500008
          ]
        },
        "202500008": {
          "id": 202500008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "But for everything else, I've got plenty of budget for recycling.",
          "next": [
            202500009
          ]
        },
        "202500009": {
          "id": 202500009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "You recycle waste, and then collect them?",
          "next": [
            202500010
          ]
        },
        "202500010": {
          "id": 202500010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "It's a step before collecting. To me, restoring old objects feels more like an \"impromptu mental journey.\"",
          "next": [
            202500011
          ]
        },
        "202500011": {
          "id": 202500011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "During my work on the \"Worlds Reborn Initiative,\" I've restored quite a few unclaimed relics over the years.",
          "next": [
            202500012
          ]
        },
        "202500012": {
          "id": 202500012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "As I piece their textures together bit by bit, visions of a foreign planet flood into my mind: wind chimes, shallow shores, glaciers, and countless civilizations and landscapes beyond description.",
          "next": [
            202500013
          ]
        },
        "202500013": {
          "id": 202500013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "After that, I usually lose myself in work for a good while.",
          "next": [
            202500014,
            202500016,
            202500019
          ]
        },
        "202500014": {
          "id": 202500014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "How I envy your hobby...",
          "next": [
            202500015
          ]
        },
        "202500015": {
          "id": 202500015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "PlayerAuto",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "It's basically your job.",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500016": {
          "id": 202500016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Bring it on, you workaholics!",
          "next": [
            202500017
          ]
        },
        "202500017": {
          "id": 202500017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Bring what on? Fuse beads?",
          "next": [
            202500018
          ]
        },
        "202500018": {
          "id": 202500018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Just kidding.",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500019": {
          "id": 202500019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "There's more to life than restoring things. Take a break. Go travel!",
          "next": [
            202500020
          ]
        },
        "202500020": {
          "id": 202500020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "That reminds me of a question the media once asked me: \"How do you balance work and life?\"",
          "next": [
            202500021
          ]
        },
        "202500021": {
          "id": 202500021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "First, I suggested they ask Louis Fleming instead. Second, I answered: \"How do you balance breathing and living?\" They didn't follow up.",
          "next": [
            202500022
          ]
        },
        "202500022": {
          "id": 202500022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Furthermore, restoring damaged items discarded by the Astral Express, or picked up along the way, is itself an artistic journey into the spirit of the Trailblaze.",
          "next": [
            202500023
          ]
        },
        "202500023": {
          "id": 202500023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "Oh, and a fun fact: pearls in the ocean are also a form of \"repurposed waste.\"",
          "next": [
            202500024
          ]
        },
        "202500024": {
          "id": 202500024,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "next": [
            202500025
          ]
        },
        "202500025": {
          "id": 202500025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1503,
          "text": "This private deal stands open-ended. I look forward to receiving \"travel finds\" from the Astral Express.",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1503,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}